{"title":"The Great War","synopsis":"Im Dajun yang ditinggalkan oleh keluarganya dan sekarang hidup sebagai pemimpin kelompok pelarian suatu hari secara kebetulan membawa pulang Yeonwoo\nYeonwoo kemudian mengamuk dengan kejam di Incheon\nYeonwoo yang mencoba membunuh ketua chaebol untuk membalas dendam dihalangi oleh Youn Gamin seorang siswa berprestasi dengan masa depan cerah\nSementara itu Nahwajin dari Biro Perlindungan Otoritas Sekolah mengamati situasi ini dengan penuh minat\nCrossover pertama di Blue String Universe Pertarungan besarbesaran yang menampilkan karakter utama dari True Education Study Group dan To Not Die\nIni adalah catatan pertarungan sengit yang tidak tercakup dalam cerita mereka sendiri","alternative_title":"대장전","author":"Shin Hyung Wook","artist":"YLAB","genres":["Action"],"chapters":[{"id":"6cddcebc-7f71-4860-a5d2-9845968d63c3","number":"60","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2025-10-09","images":[]},{"id":"a7af065c-ed57-472f-b9bd-333b2368d4e1","number":"59","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2025-09-29","images":[]},{"id":"a52cf8d2-c472-4c74-8da3-9d04b1374a04","number":"58","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2025-09-26","images":[]},{"id":"87ea61e6-df96-45c6-9a7d-e1a5de7e0961","number":"57","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2025-09-13","images":[]},{"id":"622f2098-6053-4f3a-85ea-7a765dbd5901","number":"56","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2025-09-11","images":[]},{"id":"8c52f5ff-c4ea-4a4d-914f-5093ab4c39ae","number":"55","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2025-09-09","images":[]},{"id":"ba36ece6-ae5f-4da8-aadc-1c93d876d8f7","number":"54","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2025-08-29","images":[]},{"id":"307c5ccb-0f8e-4ce6-ba86-84e5495fe0fc","number":"53","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2025-08-26","images":[]},{"id":"fd5f68ad-6b6c-41d3-bf3c-d15e10a7e1e9","number":"52","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2025-08-17","images":[]},{"id":"901b647b-c434-43fc-9fc9-d69589053398","number":"51","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2025-08-16","images":[]},{"id":"36ab1083-358d-4ac2-869e-52f65fe6d77a","num